ain segments. First we will review the key findings from our recent internal surveys and highlight the correlated behaviors that are driving success across teams. Second we will open the floor for you to share your own stories of what you are experiencing right now. This is not a report session. It is a listening session. We are here to learn from you. Third we will co create a set of simple actionable principles that we can all commit to as we move forward. These will be drafted together and then published as our team charter.\n\nWe understand that schedules are full and commitments are many. But we also believe that moments like this are what make our work meaningful. When we take the time to truly see each other to listen deeply and to align our purpose we create something far more powerful than any individual effort ever could.\n\nPlease confirm your attendance by Friday June 14th so we can prepare seating materials and ensure we have enough resources for everyone. If you have any accessibility needs or special requests do not hesitate to let us know. We are committed to making this experience inclusive and supportive for all.\n\nThank you for being the heart of this organization. Your dedication does not go unnoticed. We look forward to seeing you on June 20th and to building something remarkable together.\n\nWarm regards\n\nThe Leadership Coordination Team", "logprobs": [{"token": "Dear", "logprob": -0.038177624344825745}, {"token": " Team", "logprob": -0.2163379192352295}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.058827295899391174}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.00976653303951025}, {"token": " hope", "logprob": -0.016063088551163673}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -8.5588610090781e-05}, {"token": " message", "logprob": -2.992108420585282e-05}, {"token": " finds", "logprob": -1.7165990357170813e-05}, {"token": " you", "logprob": -0.0012512720422819257}, {"token": " well", "logprob": -0.04591896012425423}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.02225974015891552}, {"token": " 